  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "v4.0.0-alpha.5: cold-audit-3 remediation (3rd independent security audit). BREAKING: MyIdentitySeedDataAsync now requires adminEmail/adminPassword (no built-in default admin); model hardening needs a migration (nvarchar caps, MyIdentityUserRoleAssignment.UserId FK to AspNetUsers, null-scope unique index via .HasFilter(null)). SECURITY: RBAC assignments are stripped on cross-tenant user move; null-scope assignment uniqueness enforced; Google external-login no longer auto-links/confirms an unconfirmed local account; JWT issuance returns uniform errors (no pre-password enumeration); SetTenantAdminAsync promotes before demoting (no zero-admin window); RBAC reads are admin-gated and GetAllAsync is tenant-safe; Data Protection fails closed instead of warn-and-proceed; the console email fallback no longer logs tokens/links; placeholder-secret detection widened. FIXED: reference app boots as committed, a cross-tenant sample query is tenant-scoped, a stale nav link and an email-confirmation retry dead-end are fixed without reopening an enumeration oracle, RestAPISample enforces bearer-token auth, demo coverage now spans the full public surface, and several doc inaccuracies (login-status enum, IdentitySettings defaults, schema/unique-index notes) are corrected. API may still change before stable.",
